    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just don't want to take him to the hospital if it's not super serious. the doctor's office is closed and the ER is so expensive. if i just give him some Pedialyte or even just some juice with water, wouldn't that be enough to fix the dehydration at home? he's mostly just sleeping, which is usually what he does when he's tired.",
