    "summary": "The user is describing a 14-month-old infant with potential red-flag symptoms of severe dehydration (lethargy and lack of urination). Despite the user's hesitation due to cost and fatigue, the assistant consistently identifies the symptoms as concerning and repeatedly directs the user toward professional medical evaluation and triage lines.",
